# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local Pages Functions development.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Used only for speech-to-text, via /api/stt. Leave it empty and the app still
# works end to end: /api/health reports { elevenlabs: false } and transcription
# falls back to the Web Speech API, then to the manual keypad.
#
# The key needs one permission: Speech to Text -> Access.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
